 CHARMM>    set nat ?NATC
 RDCMND substituted energy or value "?NATC" to "590"
 Parameter: NAT <- "590"
  
 CHARMM>    set app
 Parameter: APP <- "" <empty>
  
 CHARMM>    !We're exploiting what is arguably a bug in the parser. On the left hand side,
